निज् pp. निक्त॑ (q.v.), I. ने॑नेक्ति, नेनिक्ते॑ wash,
cleanse, purify;
 M. refl. — अव = S.;
 C. अवनेजयति cause to wash
off. अभ्यव A.M. wash, cleanse;
 C. = prec. C. निस् A. wash off,
cleanse;
 M. wash, dress, or adorn one's self. प्र wash off, cleanse.
वि wipe off. — Cf. निर्णिक्त.

निज॑ a. inborn, indigenous, native, own;
 w. रिपु m. a foe
in one's own camp. In l. l. = a poss. pron. of all persons.
